uild from there, and we keep building together as things change."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":["$","$L2",null,{"href":"services","style":{"color":"var(--light-peach)"},"children":"Two Ways to Work Together"}]}],["$","div",null,{"children":"Choose the format that fits your life, or combine both."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Home_cards__YrC_t","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/services#training","className":"Home_card__YMJNF","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"1:1 Training Sessions"}],["$","div",null,{"children":"Work side by side with a coach who's fully focused on you."}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"In-person at Rain City Fit on Cap Hill or sports fields around Seattle"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Virtual via FaceTime, Google Meet, or your preferred platform"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"60 minutes; sliding scale $90-130 per session"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Hands-on cueing, real-time adjustments, ongoing coaching relationship"}]]}]]}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/services#programming","className":"Home_card__YMJNF","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Custom Programming"}],["$","div",null,{"children":"A program built for your body, to train on your own schedule."}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"Starts with 1-4 in-person assessment sessions, $90-130 each"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Monthly Plans from $180-260, per workout from $30-40"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Tailored to your goals, history, and available equipment"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Ideal if you want expert-level coaching without a fixed weekly schedule"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":"Rates are offered on a sliding scale based on financial access. I want cost to be as little a barrier as possible. We'll sort out the right rate together when you get in touch."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"A Different Kind of Training Relationship"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"What you can expect:"}],["$","ul",null,{"style":{"marginTop":"0"},"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"Programming designed for your body, your goals, and your life. Not a template."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"A coach who pays attention to how stress, past injuries, and your nervous system affect how you move and recover."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Real, ongoing connection that adapts as your life does."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Attention to the nuanced wins: moving pain-free, making a surprising play in sports, finally feeling an exercise work exactly where it should."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"An approach that treats recovery and sustainability as seriously as the training itself."}]]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"What you won't find here:"}],["$","div",null,{"children":"No diet culture, no shame, no cookie-cutter plans, and no drill sergeant energy. Movement isn't punishment, food isn't \"bad\", and you're a whole person, not just a set of fitness metrics."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Ready to Get Started?"}],["$","div",null,{"children":"Fill out the interest form and I'll be in touch within 48 hours. Not sure which option is the right fit? We'll talk through it together."}],["$","a",null,{"className":"Home_btn__2Gdyj","href":"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSemCFI-iCeKT35uLwsFK8yb3fAEyi4oUv151rJuMQkQ3mI8Lg/viewform?usp=sharing","children":"Fill Out the Interest Form"}]]}],[["$","link","0",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/f9a6df052d86067d.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined","nonce":"$undefined"}]],["$","$L5",null,{"children":"$L6"}]]}],{},null,false]},null,false],["$","$1","h",{"children":[null,["$","$1","3WLowp_ZC7TzKEcCLztIT",{"children":[["$","$L7",null,{"children":"$L8"}],["$","$L9",null,{"children":"$La"}],null]}]]}],false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$b","$undefined"],"s":false,"S":true}
